2026-07-27T10:18:41.7219857Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:18:41.7220326Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:18:41.7221042Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:18:41.7222106Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:18:41.7223261Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
